<title>DENMARK: Berendsen posts poor '96, sees better '97.</title>
<headline>Berendsen posts poor '96, sees better '97.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish holding group Sophus Berendsen posted as expected on Thursday lower 1996 profits due to losses in its electronics and data division but said it expected improvement in 1997.</p>
</text>
